{title: Chord Diagrams}
{define: Am base-fret 1 frets x 0 2 2 1 0}
{define C#m base-fret 4 frets 1 1 3 3 2 1}
{define: D9 4 2 2 2 1 2 -1}
{define: G#m7-5 1 2 1 1 0 - -}
{define: Uke-C base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 3}
{define: not a chord}

[Am]Shapes for [C#m]every [D9]chord
[G#m7-5]Even the odd [Uke-C]ones
